# 真・女神転生if... (Shin Megami Tensei if..., SHVC-AMXJ): the pictures of the game's font, by the hash of each as
# lib/cells.lua cuts it out of the message window (a bit a pixel, trimmed to its ink), and the character it is.
# Made with `yomikata rom-font --glyphs` from the font in the cartridge (glyph n at 0x78001 + 36n, the code n + 0x0D
# as Shin Megami Tensei numbers them; the drawn picture is a glyph's columns 3-14) and the characters of
# tables/sfc/SHVC-AMXJ.tbl; and the voiced kana, the kana with the mark (0x9B) drawn so that its first column with
# ink lies on the kana's last.
